## Adjusting the Volume

Press the VOL + button to increase the volume level or the VOL - button to decrease the volume level. To mute the sound, Press the MUTE button. The word Mute is displayed. It's convenient when you get the telephone calls. To restore the muted sound, press the MUTE button again or VOL +/- button.


